      "created_at": "2017-08-11T03:31:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Shadows of the Burning Forest can target any land. &nbsp;But neither of its abilities does anything in a land without invaders. &nbsp;So why doesn't it require invaders to be present, and ditch the text on the fear ability? &nbsp;Is it a flavor thing, or is there some mechanical reason that I'm missing?</p>",
